    "title": "Man reported missing in Hampton - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jimmy LaRoue ,\n15 hours ago\nHAMPTON, Va. (WAVY) — Hampton Police are looking for a man reported missing Wednesday.\nMarlin Delvonne Sunkins Marlin Delvonne Sunkins, 30, was reported missing Wednesday and has medical conditions which require regular medication, Hampton Police said.\nSunkins is 5-foot-10, 193 pounds with black hair, brown eyes and a medium complexion.\nAnyone with information on his location is asked to contact Hampton Police at 757-727-6111 or the Crime Line at 1-888-LOCK-U-UP.\nCopyright 2025 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to WAVY.com.\n5",
